Package: com.551.swipetoclear16
Name: SwipeToClear16
Version: 1.0.25
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Clear all Lock Screen notifications with one short downward swipe in an adjustable area on the left (80% by default), leaving the right side free for scrolling. Also disables notification tucking and the Lock Screen Search UI.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
